// ===========================================================================
//  THE FACTUAL INVENTORY
//  Looney Tunes Golden Collection, Volumes 1–4 (original North American /
//  Region 1 four-disc editions). Main-program cartoons only: bonus cartoons,
//  documentaries and featurettes are deliberately NOT in this list.
//
//  Each row records where the cartoon physically lives:
//      vol  = Golden Collection volume (1–4)
//      disc = disc within that volume (1–4)
//      pos  = position in that disc's cartoon menu (1st, 2nd, ...)
//
//  Totals: Vol 1 = 4 × 14 = 56, Vols 2–4 = 4 × 15 = 60 each → 236.
//  `npm test` enforces those totals, contiguous positions and unique titles.
//
//  NOTE ON ORDER: discs are listed in DISC-MENU order, which is NOT always
//  chronological (Volume 1 and much of Volume 2 are grouped thematically or
//  roughly alphabetically). See SOURCES.md for per-disc verification notes.
//
//  To correct an entry, edit it here. Subjective mood scores live separately
//  in ratings.ts and are matched by title, so fixing a year, director or
//  position here never disturbs them.
// ===========================================================================

